> ..190.........200.........210.........220.........230.........240.........250
> .........260.........270.........280.........290.........300.........310.....
> ....320.........330.........340.........350.........360.........370.........3
> 80.........390.........400.........410.........420.........430.........440...
> ......450.........460.........470.........480.........490.........500 done

